descr P20L8 in a 28-pin LCC package (alternative numbering)
partname p20l8mlcc PAL20L8 (LCC28, alternative pin numbering)
pins 28
pinmap 1=1 2=2 3=3 4=4 5=6 6=7 7=9 8=10 9=12 10=13 11=14 12=0 13=16 14=17 15=18 16=20 17=21 18=22 19=23 20=24 21=25 22=26 23=27 24=0
